Z||000000||curtis||09-03-2001||07:30 PM||||We have changed fuel injectors, fuel rail, fuel filter, fuel regulator, and timing chain and sprockets.  We have replaced the distributor, rotor, plug wires, coil, and now it cranks just by sticking your hand in the window and turning the key on. But it misses real bad and it only idols about 800 rpm.  help me fix it before i sell it. Just Kidding. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Urchin||09-03-2001||07:52 PM||||Got the plug wires on in the right order?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
